==Restrictions==
Unit Restriction: Only [[Secret Crush Cat (Special Cat)|Secret Crush Cat]], [[Tomboy Lion Cat (Special Cat)|Tomboy Lion Cat]], [[Chalkboard Eraser Cat (Special Cat)|Chalkboard Eraser Cat]], [[Class Rep Cat (Special Cat)|Class Rep Cat]], [[Occultist Cat (Special Cat)|Occultist Cat]] and [[Principal Cat (Special Cat)|Principal Cat]]

==Battleground==
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Be sure to stall St. Pigge the 2nd until the worker cat is maxed, then spam units. Although this stage only allows Heartbeat Catcademy units to be deployed, note that Combos can be activated.

